<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/connectivism> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A learning theory that treats knowledge as distributed across networks of connections and emphasizes continual learning, current information, and the ability to recognize connections among sources and fields." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/connectivism/versions/1> .
